#. ~ Description of variant "FBI raid jacket" of item "windbreaker"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A distinctive deep blue windbreaker with \"FBI\" emblazoned on the left "
"breast, on the sides of the sleeves, and across the back in large, yellow "
"lettering.  It is only issued to FBI field agents, preventing "
"misidentification."
msgstr ""
"Charakterystyczna ciemnoniebieska wiatrówka z dużym żółtym napisem „FBI” na "
"lewej piersi, po bokach rękawów i na plecach. Wydawana wyłącznie agentom "
"terenowym FBI, by zapobiec pomyłkom w identyfikacji."

#. ~ Item name
