#. ~ Description of "varsity jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A cotton varsity jacket, the type that the jocks in a highschool or a college"
" would wear."
msgstr ""
"Bawełniana kurtka uczelniana, taka, jaką noszą sportowcy w liceum lub na "
"studiach."

#. ~ Variant name of item "varsity jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
