#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"This one has a dark green torso and white arms.  There is an emblem of a "
"four-leaf clover with the writing \"Clover High School\" on the left arm and "
"front right."
msgstr ""
"Ta ma ciemnozielony korpus i białe rękawy. Na lewym rękawie i z przodu po "
"prawej znajduje się emblemat czterolistnej koniczyny z napisem „Clover High "
"School”."

#. ~ Variant name of item "varsity jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
