msgid_plural "Wizards varsity jackets"
msgstr[0] "kurtka uczelniana Wizards"
msgstr[1] "kurtki uczelniane Wizards"
msgstr[2] "kurtek uczelnianych Wizards"
msgstr[3] "kurtki uczelnianej Wizards"

#. ~ Description of variant "Wizards varsity jacket" of item "varsity jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"This one has a purple torso with white arms.  It has an angry looking old "
"wizard on its back, holding its staff menacingly; below it writes "
"\"WIZARDS\"."
msgstr ""
"Ta ma fioletowy korpus i białe rękawy. Na plecach jest rozgniewany stary "
"czarodziej, groźnie trzymający laskę, a pod nim napis „WIZARDS”."

#. ~ Variant name of item "varsity jacket"
